{"text": "The cart is parked at the flag, six metres along the track. A steady headwind blows, and the model knows nothing about it. The controller is the MPC from M3. The wind pushes the cart back, and it comes to rest about eleven centimetres short, holding a push of plus zero point three. Now look at the dashed curve: the plan made at ten seconds. It still expects to get back to the flag. Every tenth of a second the plan says \"I will reach the flag\", and every tenth of a second a wind it does not know about holds the cart where it is.", "lang": "en", "voice": "en-US-AndrewMultilingualNeural", "duration": 33.812, "words": [[0.113, 0.175, "The"], [0.175, 0.45, "cart"], [0.45, 0.562, "is"], [0.575, 0.9, "parked"], [0.912, 0.963, "at"], [0.975, 1.038, "the"], [1.038, 1.525, "flag"], [1.925, 2.175, "six"], [2.175, 2.45, "metres"], [2.45, 2.713, "along"], [2.712, 2.762, "the"], [2.775, 3.275, "track"], [3.663, 3.725, "A"], [3.725, 4.025, "steady"], [4.025, 4.55, "headwind"], [4.562, 5.237, "blows"], [5.487, 5.575, "and"], [5.588, 5.65, "the"], [5.65, 6.113, "model"], [6.112, 6.412, "knows"], [6.412, 6.812, "nothing"], [6.812, 7.075, "about"], [7.088, 7.238, "it"], [7.638, 7.688, "The"], [7.688, 8.312, "controller"], [8.325, 8.438, "is"], [8.438, 8.537, "the"], [8.662, 9.375, "M-P-C"], [9.387, 9.562, "from"], [9.562, 10.162, "M3"], [10.562, 10.675, "The"], [10.675, 11.15, "wind"], [11.162, 11.55, "pushes"], [11.562, 11.65, "the"], [11.65, 11.975, "cart"], [11.975, 12.375, "back"], [12.812, 12.85, "and"], [12.85, 12.925, "it"], [12.938, 13.188, "comes"], [13.188, 13.287, "to"], [13.287, 13.65, "rest"], [13.662, 13.95, "about"], [13.95, 14.412, "eleven"], [14.412, 14.963, "centimetres"], [14.963, 15.375, "short"], [15.825, 16.05, "holding"], [16.05, 16.1, "a"], [16.1, 16.425, "push"], [16.425, 16.538, "of"], [16.55, 17.038, "plus"], [17.05, 17.387, "zero"], [17.4, 17.725, "point"], [17.725, 18.175, "three"], [18.575, 18.787, "Now"], [19.075, 19.212, "look"], [19.212, 19